config VIDEO_SPRD_VSP
	tristate "Unisoc VSP video and JPEG codec driver"
	depends on ARCH_SPRD || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on PM
	depends on DEBUG_FS
	depends on VIDEO_DEV
	depends on MEDIA_CONTROLLER
	select PM_GENERIC_DOMAINS
	select V4L2_MEM2MEM_DEV
	select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_CONTIG
	help
	  Powers up the video codec (VSP) and JPEG codec blocks of the Unisoc UMS9230
	  and exposes a register dump in debugfs. On the VSP it also registers an
	  EXPERIMENTAL stateless H.264 decoder (intra slices only for now) written
	  from a reverse-engineered register map; it has not been verified on hardware.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called sprd-vsp.
